---@alias cloudflare.load_balancers.CreateRequestRulesItemOverridesSessionAffinityAttributesZeroDowntimeFailover "none"|"temporary"|"sticky"

---@alias cloudflare.load_balancers.CreateRequestRulesItemOverridesSteeringPolicy "off"|"geo"|"random"|"dynamic_latency"|"proximity"|"least_outstanding_requests"|"least_connections"|""

