---@field priority? number|distilled.Null The order in which rules should be executed in relation to each other. Lower values are executed first. Values do not need to be sequential. If all priorities are omitted or zero, the API assigns priorities based on the array order of the rules field.
---@field terminates? boolean|distilled.Null If this rule's condition is true, this causes rule evaluation to stop after processing this rule.

