---@class cloudflare.load_balancers.EditResponsePoolSetsItem
---@field disabled? boolean|distilled.Null Disable this specific pool set. It will no longer be evaluated.
---@field fixed_response? cloudflare.load_balancers.EditResponsePoolSetsItemFixedResponse|distilled.Null A collection of fields used to directly respond to the client instead of routing to a pool. When supplied on a rule, that rule stops further rule evaluation.
---@field match? cloudflare.load_balancers.EditResponsePoolSetsItemMatch|distilled.Null Determines which requests a pool set applies to. Set `topology` to match by location or `default: true` to match all requests; the two are mutually exclusive. A pool set with no `match` matches all requests.
---@field name? string|distilled.Null A human-readable name for this pool set.
---@field overrides? cloudflare.load_balancers.EditResponsePoolSetsItemOverrides|distilled.Null The behavior a pool set applies when its `match` succeeds. A strict subset of a rule's `overrides`: a pool set replaces the topology wholesale with a flat pool list (`pools`), so only the declarative pool-routing fields plus `fallback_pool` and `steering_policy` are settable. All fields are optional.

