---@field regions? cloudflare.load_balancers.EditResponsePoolSetsItemMatchTopologyRegionsList|distilled.Null A list of Cloudflare region codes (e.g. `WNAM`, `ENAM`, `WEU`). Matches when the request's region is in this list.

