---@field id? string|distilled.Null
---@field check_regions? cloudflare.load_balancers.PoolsGetResponseCheckRegionsList|distilled.Null A list of regions from which to run health checks. Null means every Cloudflare data center.
---@field created_on? string|distilled.Null
---@field description? string|distilled.Null A human-readable description of the pool.
