---@alias cloudflare.load_balancers.UpdateResponseRulesItemOverridesPopPoolsValueList string[]

---@class cloudflare.load_balancers.UpdateResponseRulesItemOverridesRandomSteering
---@field default_weight? number|distilled.Null The default weight for pools in the load balancer that are not specified in the pool_weights map. An omitted value inherits the load balancer's default weight.
---@field pool_weights? cloudflare.load_balancers.UpdateResponseRulesItemOverridesRandomSteeringPoolWeightsMap|distilled.Null A mapping of pool IDs to custom weights. The weight is relative to other pools in the load balancer.

